  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This soup serves 4 and takes about 1 hour 30 minutes in total. The critical step is the onions: they need a full 45-60 minutes over low heat to turn from sharp and pale to sweet and deeply brown. Rush them and the soup will taste raw."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use oven-proof soup bowls so you can grill them directly. If you do not have those, ladle into regular bowls and grill the croutons separately then float them on top."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
